NPCs: {
	EnchanterNPC: {
		DisplayName: Enchanter

		TownNPCMood: {
			Content: My spirits are at restt.
			NoHome: Please, get me a home. No rest means wicked spiritss.
			FarFromHome: Lots of space here, but I feel tiredd. I would like to reset my energy state back at home.
			LoveSpace: Loving the free space!
			DislikeCrowded: I think I accidentally injured someone with my magicc. Please, get them to a safer space.
			HateCrowded: There's too many people here, and they're draining all my energyy!
			LikeBiome: "{BiomeName} is pleasant. Plenty of free space for practicing my magickss."
			DislikeBiome: The {BiomeName} has no latent energy for me to channell.
			HateBiome: Despite there being so much aura in {BiomeName}, it's impossible to focus welll!
			LoveNPC: There's so many topics to discuss with {NPCName}!
			LikeNPC: I've enjoyed researching {NPCName}'s hexess.
			DislikeNPC: I dislike {NPCName}.
			HateNPC: I hate dealing with children, especially {NPCName}.
			Princess_LovesNPC: I just love seeing {NPCName} do cool tricks! Wish she'd treat me similarly, though...
			LikeNPC_Princess: I like {NPCName}.
		}

		Bestiary: Coming from the far lands of Bulgaria, this Enchanter helps anyone imbue latent armor energy into her collection of gems.

		Names: {
			Misty: Misty
			Carousel: Carousel
			Magicad: Magicad
			Glorks: Glorks
			Finellie: Finellie
			Jarlsova: Jarlsova
			Michelangela: Michelangela
		}

		Chat: {
			Normal1: Tra-la-la!
			Normal2: Stand back! I'm practicing a new spell.
			Normal3: I cast, therefore I do.
			EnchantSuccess1: It workedd! I managed to capture the essence of your worn armor into one of my gems, and it should be able to retain the essence for... essentially foreverr! On the house.
			EnchantSuccess2: With this hex, the potent energy in this gem should stay pure for a good while. Make sure to make good use of itt!
			EnchantFail1: I can capture latent energy from your worn armor in one of the gems I have, but a mismatch of pieces won't do! Try coming back once your worn gear synergizess.
			EnchantFail2: I'm able to trap some power from your worn armor into this gem here, but I can't channel it well unless you come to me with a matching sett.
			EnchantFail3: With enough effort, your armor's force can be split into this here gem, but I can only do it if your armor matchess!
			EnchantTomorrow1: I only have enough mana to enchant a gem once a dayy. Come back tomorrow for my offerss.
			EnchantTomorrow2: I'd love to enchant another gem for you! But I can't do it more than once a day without overworking myselff.
		}

		EnchantButton: Enchant
	}
}

